abstract: "A Public Preview protocol for reviewing evidence before committing engineering resources to a defined workflow. It requires a measured baseline and evidence suited to the risk tier, and reports evaluation costs separately from operational oversight. Verification uses synthetic software fixtures. No controlled empirical validation or operational performance is claimed."
